---
// Bespoke CTA Banner
---

<section class="w-full py-space-xl">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-margin md:px-margin-md lg:px-margin-lg">
    <div class="relative bg-primary-container text-on-primary rounded-xl overflow-hidden p-space-xl md:p-space-2xl shadow-xl scroll-reveal-scale">

      <!-- Decorative SVG -->
      <svg class="absolute -right-20 -bottom-20 w-96 h-96 text-secondary-fixed/5 pointer-events-none" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="80" stroke="currentColor" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="1.5"></circle>
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="60" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"></circle>
        <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="40" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="0.75"></circle>
        <path d="M20 140 C 60 110, 140 180, 180 130" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"></path>
      </svg>

      <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-xl items-center">

        <!-- Copy -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-space-xs text-secondary-fixed font-label-md text-label-md uppercase tracking-widest">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">explore</span>
            <span>Tailored Private Journeys</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-surface font-normal">
            Craft Your Bespoke Latin American Odyssey
          </h2>
          <p class="font-subhead text-subhead text-surface/85 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
            Whether you crave sunrise volcano ascents in Guatemala, remote biological research outposts in Osa Peninsula, or secluded coral atolls in Belize, our regional expedition architects design every day to your rhythm.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- CTAs -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-space-sm sm:flex-row lg:flex-col justify-center">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-surface text-primary px-space-lg py-space-md rounded font-label-lg text-label-lg uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-all text-center shadow-md"
          >
            Schedule Private Consultation
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/14437225210?text=Hello!%20I%20would%20like%20to%20consult%20on%20a%20private%20Mountains%20to%20Coast%20trip."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-space-xs text-surface bg-surface/10 hover:bg-surface/20 px-space-lg py-space-md rounded font-label-lg text-label-lg uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors text-center"
          >
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">chat</span>
            WhatsApp Regional Concierge
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
